      license: "Public domain: the Rijksmuseum object record states 'Copyright: Public domain' with a link to the Public Domain Mark 1.0, its open-data policy (3.7.1) provides such material under PDM or CC0, and the Rijksmuseum scan is also on Wikimedia Commons under CC0; the photographer is anonymous and the plate dates from about 1891 and in or before 1896.",
